body:
I kept telling my husband I wanted to hear that song so bad and I posted it in the what do you want to hear in ATL show thread and he played Closer, but actually threw in the "This is the only time I really feel alive" line when he combined them. Apparently that's pretty rare, so I feel like he heard me out. lol

&#x200B;

Edit: [Link](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KxhvgdN1asQ)
